# THE CABLE BRACE'S LINE (GEAR.md §6, G8): the grapple, from the tower-cable
# brace, takes a machine's working part that faces it: the part glints and
# stalls, and the line pulls the player in to the edge of its body. A harvester
# in front and locked on, its working part (its front) turned to the player as
# it tells its bite.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/cable_brace.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --fit=brace_cable
coast calm
place spawn
wait 1.0
spawn harvester
hold target
await target 3
tell harvester
wait 0.1
tap ability_grapple
await cabled 3
shot 01-the-line-takes-the-part with mob:harvester
wait 0.5
shot 02-pulled-in-to-it with mob:harvester
release target
